我们一直保持可观测量固定来跟踪态。这就是 Schrödinger 绘景。设 $A$ 是一个没有显式时间依赖性的可观测量。它的期望值是 $\langle A\rangle_t
=
\bra{\psi(t)}A\ket{\psi(t)}.$ 对左矢和右矢都求导： $\frac{d}{dt}\langle A\rangle_t
=
\bra{\dot\psi}A\ket{\psi}
+
\bra{\psi}A\ket{\dot\psi}.$ Schrödinger 方程及其厄米共轭给出 $\ket{\dot\psi}
=-\frac{i}{\hbar}H\ket{\psi},
\qquad
\bra{\dot\psi}
=\frac{i}{\hbar}\bra{\psi}H.$ 因此 $\begin{aligned}\frac{d}{dt}\langle A\rangle_t
&=
\frac{i}{\hbar}\bra{\psi}HA\ket{\psi}
-\frac{i}{\hbar}\bra{\psi}AH\ket{\psi} \\
&=
\frac{i}{\hbar}\bra{\psi}(HA-AH)\ket{\psi}.\end{aligned}$ 定义对易子 $[H,A]=HA-AH.$ 那么期望值的运动方程是 $\boxed{
\frac{d}{dt}\langle A\rangle_t
=
\frac{i}{\hbar}\langle[H,A]\rangle_t
}.$

p.src:
Set $A=H$. An operator always commutes with itself: $[H,H]=HH-HH=0.$ Therefore $\boxed{
\frac{d}{dt}\langle H\rangle_t=0
}.$ The expectation value of the Hamiltonian is conserved. This is the promised structural reason for identifying $H$ as energy. Every isolated system has a Hamiltonian, and every time-independent Hamiltonian supplies this conservation law.

